That is the standard library 'queue' for threaded programming, which
has nothing to do with Simpy.

AFAIK, all queues in Simpy are FIFO, and I don't know of any trivial
LIFO example (i.e., setting some parameter or a predefined class, and
not involving increasing priorities).

